# CVE-2026-14456 affects the OpenSSL QUIC server path. Redis uses OpenSSL for
# its TLS runtime but does not expose an OpenSSL QUIC server.
# Recheck this exception whenever the locked Redis image changes.
CVE-2026-14456
#
# CVE-2026-84782 affects Alpine libcrypto3 3.3.7-r1 (fixed in 3.3.7-r2) and is
# reachable only through OpenSSL TLS/session handling. This deployment does not
# enable TLS: redis.conf.template listens plaintext on 6379 with password
# authentication on the internal redis networks, and the 7.4.11-alpine tag has
# not been rebuilt, so no fixed image is available.
# Re-verified 2026-10-18 with trivy 0.76.0.
CVE-2026-84782
